<title>CANADA: Cineplex confirms talks with Sony.</title>
<headline>Cineplex confirms talks with Sony.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cineplex Odeon Corp confirmed on Friday that it was in discussions with Sony Corp subsidiary Loews Theaters Group regarding a possible merger.</p>
<p>Cineplex said in a statement that the terms of the deal being discussed would have Loews join with Cineplex shareholders in the combined entity.</p>
<p>The theater chain owner added that no assurance could be given that an agreement would be reached.</p>
<p>Cineplex shares were up 0.23 to 2.85 at midday today on the Toronto Stock Exchange after strengthening on Thursday on published reports about the talks.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100))</p>
